{"seq":2,"slug":"transit-declaration-process-orchestration","title":"起运—途中—目的地海关的过境申报流程编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/tir-ncts-declaration-transit-procedure/transit-declaration-process-orchestration","wordCount":2842,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"起运-途中-目的地海关的过境申报流程编排\">起运—途中—目的地海关的过境申报流程编排</h1><p>一票中欧陆运货物从霍尔果斯出境、经哈萨克斯坦与白俄罗斯、在波兰马拉舍维奇清关。申报人在起运地发出的报文，此后十几天里被三个互不可见国家的海关系统依次消费（起运放行、途中记录通过、目的地核销解除担保）。<a href=\"tir-ncts-message-model-data-spec\">过境申报单信息模型与数据字段规范</a> 已讲清单条报文的字段，难点在<strong>把一次运输编排成跨系统、跨法律管辖、可收敛的状态机</strong>：谁在何时拥有状态、异常如何收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次过境运输在海关语义里是一个 <strong><code>movement</code>（运输过程）对象</strong>，而非静态单据。它有唯一主键（NCTS 的 MRN、TIR 的车本编号）、有生命周期状态，状态沿三类海关办公室顺序流转：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>办公室角色</th>\n<th>NCTS 术语</th>\n<th>TIR 术语</th>\n<th>核心动作</th>\n<th>输出事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起运地</td>\n<td>Office of Departure</td>\n<td>Customs office of departure</td>\n<td>受理申报、校验担保、风险分析、封志</td>\n<td>分配 MRN、放行进入过境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>途经地</td>\n<td>Office of Transit</td>\n<td>Customs office en route</td>\n<td>核对封志完整性、记录通过时刻</td>\n<td>过境通过记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的地</td>\n<td>Office of Destination</td>\n<td>Customs office of destination</td>\n<td>接受到达通知、查验、终结</td>\n<td>到达确认、货物放行、担保解除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>担保方</td>\n<td>Office of Guarantee</td>\n<td>Guarantee association / IRU</td>\n<td>记账、额度扣减与释放</td>\n<td>担保引用、额度账务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>编排的第一条原则：<strong>状态的所有权必须单一且可转移</strong>。起运地放行前 movement 由起运地系统拥有；放行后所有权&quot;在途&quot;，途经地只能追加事件、不能改主状态；目的地终结后归目的地海关，担保记账随之关闭。这与 <code>1_customs-transit-regime-guarantee-model</code> 里 <a href=\"../customs-transit-regime-guarantee-model/guarantee-instrument-liability-allocation\">担保工具与责任分配</a> 的责任链是一体两面——<strong>责任随所有权移动</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[申报人&lt;br/&gt;提交过境申报] --&gt; B[起运地海关&lt;br/&gt;校验担保与字段]&#10;    B --&gt; C{担保有效且风险可接受?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| C2[退回申报&lt;br/&gt;拒绝放行]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[分配 MRN&lt;br/&gt;放行进入过境]&#10;    D --&gt; E[在途&lt;br/&gt;所有权悬空]&#10;    E --&gt; F{是否经过途经地海关?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[途经地核销&lt;br/&gt;记录通过, 追加事件]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H&#10;    G --&gt; H[目的地海关&lt;br/&gt;到达通知]&#10;    H --&gt; I{查验通过?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| I2[立案: 超期/封志异常/货不符]&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[终结过境&lt;br/&gt;释放担保额度]&#10;    E -.超期未到达.-&gt; I2\">flowchart TD\n    A[申报人&lt;br/&gt;提交过境申报] --&gt; B[起运地海关&lt;br/&gt;校验担保与字段]\n    B --&gt; C{担保有效且风险可接受?}\n    C --&gt;|否| C2[退回申报&lt;br/&gt;拒绝放行]\n    C --&gt;|是| D[分配 MRN&lt;br/&gt;放行进入过境]\n    D --&gt; E[在途&lt;br/&gt;所有权悬空]\n    E --&gt; F{是否经过途经地海关?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[途经地核销&lt;br/&gt;记录通过, 追加事件]\n    F --&gt;|否| H\n    G --&gt; H[目的地海关&lt;br/&gt;到达通知]\n    H --&gt; I{查验通过?}\n    I --&gt;|否| I2[立案: 超期/封志异常/货不符]\n    I --&gt;|是| J[终结过境&lt;br/&gt;释放担保额度]\n    E -.超期未到达.-&gt; I2</pre><p>跨国层面分两种编排：NCTS 是<strong>联邦式（choreography）</strong>，各成员国运行自己的国家级系统，靠统一报文对齐；eTIR 是<strong>中心化（orchestration）</strong>，UNECE 的 eTIR 国际系统作为唯一中介路由报文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"起运海关-受理-担保校验与放行编排\">起运海关：受理、担保校验与放行编排</h2><p>起运地海关是整条链上唯一做<strong>准入决策</strong>的节点。申报人提交过境申报（NCTS 的 IE015，TIR 的电子预申报 TIR-EPD）后，系统依次执行：字段校验、担保校验、风险分析、封志与放行。</p>\n<p>担保校验不是查&quot;有没有担保&quot;，而是查<strong>这笔担保此刻是否可用</strong>：担保引用（GRN + 4 位访问码）是否有效、是否被限制、剩余额度是否覆盖本次税费敞口。设税费敞口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、担保池剩余额度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，则放行必要条件之一是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>exempt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge E = \\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left(D_i + T_i\\right) - R_{\\text{exempt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exempt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个货项应缴关税与国内税，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>exempt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{exempt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exempt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为豁免基准。综合担保（comprehensive guarantee）的额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 不按单票计算，而按参考期内多次运输税费均值的某个比例设定，比例可为 100%、50% 或 30%（依 UCC 授权条例 (EU) 2015/2446）。这意味着<strong>放行编排必须在担保池上做原子扣减</strong>——一笔 GRN 可被多票在途货物同时引用，扣减若不幂等或有竞态就会&quot;额度超卖&quot;。</p>\n<p>放行后起运地系统生成后续编排依赖的三个锚点：<strong>MRN</strong>（18 位，自含年份与国家码，见姊妹篇）、<strong>时间限制（time limit for discharge）</strong>、可打印的 TAD 或电子等价物。设放行时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、时限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，则目的地终结不得晚于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 + \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，越界即进入超期分支。两个高频缺陷：担保扣减与放行分成两个非事务性步骤，崩溃后留下&quot;已扣额度、未放行&quot;的悬挂；MRN 生成与时限设定拆开，使目的地无法仅凭 MRN 复原时限。正确做法是把&quot;分配标识 + 记时限 + 扣担保&quot;绑为一个<strong>聚合内的一致性边界</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"途中-途经-海关-路线核销与偏离识别\">途中（途经）海关：路线核销与偏离识别</h2><p>途经地海关的编排是<strong>只追加（append-only）<strong>的：核对封志完整性、记录通过时刻与路线合法性，写一条过境通过事件，不改 movement 主状态。这是法律约束——起运地放行后中间国无权重新做准入判断，只能监督&quot;货物是否按核准路线、封志完好地通过&quot;。因此途经地事件应是</strong>幂等的事件追加</strong>。</p>\n<p>路线合法性依赖 <strong>核准路线（itinerary / prescribed route）</strong>——起运地海关放行时写入的一串按序排列的海关办公室代码。代码来自受控代码表：欧盟的 <strong>Customs Office List（COL）</strong> 规定每个办公室由两位国家代码加六位字母数字构成（如 <code>DE004251</code>），TIR 与 eTIR 则用 UN/LOCODE。判断&quot;这次通过是否在核准路线上&quot;时，比较代码集合成员关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"onTransitOfficeEvent(movement, officeCode):&#10;    if officeCode not in movement.itinerary.offices:&#10;        raise DeviationDetected(movement.mrn, officeCode)&#10;    if movement.hasEvent(TRANSIT_PASSAGE, officeCode):&#10;        return DUPLICATE_IGNORED        # 幂等&#10;    movement.appendEvent(TRANSIT_PASSAGE, officeCode, now())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>onTransitOfficeEvent(movement, officeCode):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if officeCode not in movement.itinerary.offices:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        raise DeviationDetected(movement.mrn, officeCode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if movement.hasEvent(TRANSIT_PASSAGE, officeCode):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return DUPLICATE_IGNORED        # 幂等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    movement.appendEvent(TRANSIT_PASSAGE, officeCode, now())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>偏离分两类：<strong>计划内改道</strong>（itinerary 变更，须由有权机关批准并登记）与<strong>计划外偏离</strong>（未按路线通过、封志破损）。前者是正常编排分支，后者触发立案。TIR 体系里途中改道还受车本凭证张数约束——一张车本按 4/6/10/14/20 张凭证分联，须与计划途经点匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目的地海关-到达-查验与过境终结编排\">目的地海关：到达、查验与过境终结编排</h2><p>目的地是整个状态机的汇合点与终结点。编排序列为：接受到达通知（NCTS 的 IE006）→ 呈现货物并查验（IE018 记录查验结果）→ 放行并终结（IE025）。终结是<strong>不可逆动作</strong>：一旦终结，担保责任解除、额度释放回池、movement 冻结为已终结，此后只能通过查询通道（IE140/IE141）复盘。</p>\n<p>终结与担保记账的耦合是关键正确性点。若终结报文到达担保系统滞后或丢失，会出现&quot;货物已放行、额度未释放&quot;的假性占用；反之若额度先释放、终结后到，两票货可能争抢同一额度。因此终结编排应遵循<strong>两阶段确认</strong>：先落&quot;到达已确认&quot;，再落&quot;担保已解除&quot;，两步各自幂等、同 MRN 关联，可各自重试而收敛。</p>\n<p>对<strong>简化程序</strong>，终点侧还有一个独立分支：经授权的收货人（authorized consignee）可在自有场所接收货物，无需先在目的地海关呈现。此时到达事件的产生方从海关变成企业系统，编排器必须校验该主体的授权范围与有效期，否则&quot;企业自报到达&quot;会绕过监管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨系统编排-联邦式与中心化两种拓扑\">跨系统编排：联邦式与中心化两种拓扑</h2><p>同一业务链在两种拓扑下的责任分布截然不同，这是设计跨国过境集成时最先要定的架构决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 联邦式[NCTS: 联邦式编排]&#10;      D1[起运国系统] &lt;--&gt; COMMON[公共域组件&lt;br/&gt;担保管理/查询]&#10;      D1 &lt;--&gt; T1[途经国系统]&#10;      T1 &lt;--&gt; OB1[目的国系统]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中心化[eTIR: 中心化编排]&#10;      D2[起运国海关] --&gt; HUB[eTIR 国际系统&lt;br/&gt;UNECE 运营]&#10;      T2[途经国海关] --&gt; HUB&#10;      OB2[目的国海关] --&gt; HUB&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 联邦式[NCTS: 联邦式编排]\n      D1[起运国系统] &lt;--&gt; COMMON[公共域组件&lt;br/&gt;担保管理/查询]\n      D1 &lt;--&gt; T1[途经国系统]\n      T1 &lt;--&gt; OB1[目的国系统]\n    end\n    subgraph 中心化[eTIR: 中心化编排]\n      D2[起运国海关] --&gt; HUB[eTIR 国际系统&lt;br/&gt;UNECE 运营]\n      T2[途经国海关] --&gt; HUB\n      OB2[目的国海关] --&gt; HUB\n    end</pre><p><strong>NCTS（欧盟及共同过境公约国）</strong> 属联邦式：各成员国运行本国系统（Transit Domain），跨国交互靠统一的 IE 报文与 <strong>CCN/CSI</strong> 网络，需共享语义的部分（担保管理、查询路由）由<strong>公共域（Common Domain）</strong> 承担。复杂度在<strong>对齐</strong>——NCTS Phase 5 把字段统一到 <strong>EUCDM（欧盟海关数据模型）</strong>，EUCDM 又对齐 <strong>WCO Data Model 第 3 版</strong>（世界海关组织，wcoomd.org），收益是编排器可假设&quot;起运国的 IE015 与目的国理解的 IE015 同义&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>eTIR</strong> 属中心化：UNECE《1975 年 TIR 公约》的 <strong>Annex 11（计算机化）</strong> 提供法律基础，UNECE 的 <strong>eTIR 国际系统</strong>作为唯一中介路由海关之间的报文（来源：UNECE，unece.org/transit/tir）；担保链由 <strong>IRU（国际道路运输联盟，iru.org）</strong> 及国家担保协会提供，单张车本担保上限自 2016 年起提高至 <strong>20 万美元</strong>。中心化把跨系统一致性集中到一个平台，代价是它成为单点。中国 2016 年加入 TIR 公约，2019 年 7 月开行首票 TIR 运输；区域层面还有 2020 年 10 月启用的<strong>东盟过境系统（ACTS）</strong>。两种主拓扑对编排器的差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>联邦式（NCTS）</th>\n<th>中心化（eTIR）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由责任</td>\n<td>由各国系统按 MRN 自行定位目的地</td>\n<td>由中心平台路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义对齐</td>\n<td>靠 EUCDM/报文集强约束</td>\n<td>靠平台统一 schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败域</td>\n<td>单国系统故障只影响本国段</td>\n<td>平台故障影响全链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性模型</td>\n<td>最终一致，跨系统靠报文补偿</td>\n<td>平台内可做强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展新成员成本</td>\n<td>改造本国系统 + 对齐字段</td>\n<td>主要是对接平台接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异常编排与状态收敛\">异常编排与状态收敛</h2><p>真实运输大多不走理想路径，编排器必须为每条异常定义明确的<strong>收敛动作</strong>，否则 movement 会永久滞留在中间态。四类高频异常：</p>\n<p><strong>超期未到达。</strong> 目的地终结时刻超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 + \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 即自动立案，动作是把 movement 从&quot;在途&quot;迁移到&quot;超期&quot;，触发担保方通知义务并启动追溯查询（NCTS 的 IE140/IE141 通道）。</p>\n<p><strong>取消与修正。</strong> 放行后、终结前，申报人可请求修正（IE004 → IE014）或整票取消（IE005 → IE009），取消须回滚释放担保额度。这里幂等风险最高：取消请求与目的地终结报文可能<strong>并发</strong>到达，编排器必须用版本号拒绝后到的一方，绝不能&quot;已终结又取消&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>封志异常与货不符。</strong> 封志破损或货量与申报不符时，movement 进入查验/立案分支，担保敞口从&quot;潜在&quot;变为&quot;现实&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>简化程序下的主体失效。</strong> 授权发货人/收货人在途被撤销授权时，正确做法是让<strong>已放行部分继续按原时限完成</strong>（法律不溯及），拒绝新的简化放行。\n状态机实现上，把每个 movement 表示为带<strong>版本号</strong>的聚合根，事件追加前校验期望版本，跨系统一致性靠<strong>幂等重放 + 超时补偿</strong>而非分布式事务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>仅当 version</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>expected</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{n+1} = f(s_n,\\ e)\\quad\\text{仅当}\\ \\text{version}(s_n) = v_{\\text{expected}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仅当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">version</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 为待应用事件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为状态转移函数，版本不匹配即拒绝并转入对账，把&quot;跨国最终一致&quot;收敛为每个节点内部可测的乐观锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>编排对象是一个 <code>movement</code> 状态机，状态所有权在&quot;起运地 → 在途 → 目的地&quot;间单向转移，<strong>责任随所有权移动</strong>。</li>\n<li>起运地是唯一准入决策点，须把&quot;分配 MRN + 记时限 + 扣担保&quot;绑为一次原子提交，否则会额度超卖或悬挂。</li>\n<li>途经地是 append-only 事件追加方，靠受控代码表（COL / UN/LOCODE）判定路线合法性，重复上报须幂等。</li>\n<li>目的地终结不可逆，终结与担保释放应两阶段确认，同 MRN 关联并允许各自重试。</li>\n<li>先在**联邦式（NCTS/EUCDM）<strong>与</strong>中心化（eTIR/UNECE）**间决策；四类异常都要有显式收敛动作，用版本号 + 幂等重放替代分布式事务。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：公约条款、报文代码、拓扑与担保参数以 UNECE TIR 公约文本、欧盟 TAXUD 的 NCTS Phase 5 规范、UCC 授权条例 (EU) 2015/2446 与 WCO Data Model 为准；费率、时限随各国实施调整，落地前应查对应海关最新公告。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"起运—途中—目的地海关的过境申报流程编排","id":"起运-途中-目的地海关的过境申报流程编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"起运海关：受理、担保校验与放行编排","id":"起运海关-受理-担保校验与放行编排"},{"level":2,"text":"途中（途经）海关：路线核销与偏离识别","id":"途中-途经-海关-路线核销与偏离识别"},{"level":2,"text":"目的地海关：到达、查验与过境终结编排","id":"目的地海关-到达-查验与过境终结编排"},{"level":2,"text":"跨系统编排：联邦式与中心化两种拓扑","id":"跨系统编排-联邦式与中心化两种拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"异常编排与状态收敛","id":"异常编排与状态收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TIR-EPD 与 NCTS 申报数据模型及消息规范（MRN/IE 报文）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/tir-ncts-declaration-transit-procedure/tir-ncts-message-model-data-spec"},"next":{"title":"申报驳回、变更、超期与重试的异常处置实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-transit-tir-ncts-bonded-through-transport/tir-ncts-declaration-transit-procedure/declaration-rejection-amendment-retry-ops"}}